    "deployed = reproduction + 1,200 synthetic Indian posts (600 scam, 600 genuine); cut-off 0.50 chosen on validation for AI + red flags.",
    "Indian test sets are synthetic (held-out phrases) or hand-written; they are not real collected scams."
